    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/68b61ff488cd0463fc254536abcfe7a4.webp?t=1747779916\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IslaNode: Rescue Signal</strong> takes players on a survival adventure like no other, set on a deserted island with nothing but natural resources and your wits. Stranded alone, you\u2019ll need to explore, gather materials, and use a unique node-based crafting system to transform basic elements into survival tools. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/60b37c153ace2361c74ef1cc75c44872.webp?t=1747779916\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/76e7e7b82a88133a41c6f67a9b2bac38.poster.avif?t=1747779916\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/76e7e7b82a88133a41c6f67a9b2bac38.webm?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/76e7e7b82a88133a41c6f67a9b2bac38.mp4?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Combine world resources to craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/759a13d05418ee81222879f982309024.webp?t=1747779916\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/6c56417914ec0bc471701ecbd9acfbab.poster.avif?t=1747779916\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/6c56417914ec0bc471701ecbd9acfbab.webm?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/6c56417914ec0bc471701ecbd9acfbab.mp4?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building allows you to create more complex shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/b43666b04e39b015a6f145b4e34c6cb3.webp?t=1747779916\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/33b0f6b28ac5eceb5000f09126ae7f36.poster.avif?t=1747779916\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/33b0f6b28ac5eceb5000f09126ae7f36.webm?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/33b0f6b28ac5eceb5000f09126ae7f36.mp4?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal? Construct a towering lighthouse to signal for help and secure your escape. Each resource you gather, from wood to stone, plays a crucial role in building a sturdy, weather-resistant tower as you face the challenges of the island environment. With vibrant, cartoony visuals and an intuitive crafting interface, <i><strong>IslaNode</strong></i> combines the thrill of survival with the satisfaction of creative construction.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/68b61ff488cd0463fc254536abcfe7a4.webp?t=1747779916\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IslaNode: Rescue Signal</strong> takes players on a survival adventure like no other, set on a deserted island with nothing but natural resources and your wits. Stranded alone, you\u2019ll need to explore, gather materials, and use a unique node-based crafting system to transform basic elements into survival tools. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/60b37c153ace2361c74ef1cc75c44872.webp?t=1747779916\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/76e7e7b82a88133a41c6f67a9b2bac38.poster.avif?t=1747779916\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/76e7e7b82a88133a41c6f67a9b2bac38.webm?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/76e7e7b82a88133a41c6f67a9b2bac38.mp4?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Combine world resources to craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/759a13d05418ee81222879f982309024.webp?t=1747779916\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/6c56417914ec0bc471701ecbd9acfbab.poster.avif?t=1747779916\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/6c56417914ec0bc471701ecbd9acfbab.webm?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/6c56417914ec0bc471701ecbd9acfbab.mp4?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building allows you to create more complex shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/b43666b04e39b015a6f145b4e34c6cb3.webp?t=1747779916\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/33b0f6b28ac5eceb5000f09126ae7f36.poster.avif?t=1747779916\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/33b0f6b28ac5eceb5000f09126ae7f36.webm?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/extras/33b0f6b28ac5eceb5000f09126ae7f36.mp4?t=1747779916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal? Construct a towering lighthouse to signal for help and secure your escape. Each resource you gather, from wood to stone, plays a crucial role in building a sturdy, weather-resistant tower as you face the challenges of the island environment. With vibrant, cartoony visuals and an intuitive crafting interface, <i><strong>IslaNode</strong></i> combines the thrill of survival with the satisfaction of creative construction.</p>",
